  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_827666bdd3f24148a4ec85daa5750036",
      "statement": "Local development supports two loops that share the same root Turbo/npm-workspace commands: a host-native Node 20 loop (npm install, npm run dev) and a shared containerized loop where Docker is the only host requirement and ./scripts/dev.sh up starts Postgres, SeaweedFS S3, db-init, and hot-reloading web and API servers from one forceorg-dev image.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.dev.yml#L1-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7239d83a37e7e714e1babd7aee4b886b475cd6c891fd3ee8e13daacccd788f90:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/DEV_ENVIRONMENT.md#L1-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:290dc126b0186bca581844ea80d938d2b30ef1719a140c5332c7f2e059d394de:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/DEV_NOTES.md#L25-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:94d461545c71b98c143fe4ecf0e82f753b814d19311cb7540e58e863a0e09746:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_46a34069a30e46419dff99986167b3ce",
      "statement": "The host toolchain is pinned by the repo itself: .nvmrc pins Node 20, package.json requires node >=20.0.0 with packageManager npm@10.8.0, and the root .npmrc sets include=dev so installs never skip devDependencies.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.npmrc#L1-L1",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a4e4b88cb3f8c49a32bccbf88da534fc4c0ab7c96000a3a265f7e1640053f14:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://.nvmrc#L1-L1",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5378796307535df3ec8d8b15a2e2dc5641419c3d3060cfe32238c0fa973f7aa3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L24-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7d95c218dd1248c275c40398763aec739172e3fb009517447f52952be261929b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ca9db291e2ed4075b5bcd005f82b682e",
      "statement": "Root npm scripts are a thin workspace façade: build/lint/test/test:coverage run turbo tasks, dev runs turbo dev filtered to @forceorg/web and @forceorg/api, test:e2e delegates to the web workspace, and db:generate/db:migrate/db:seed forward to packages/db-client's prisma generate, prisma migrate dev, and tsx prisma/seed.ts.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L10-L23",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:746a4d8d68769fcdfaaeb85ac28f64f84b839dc24874f7f0b5b6cf5cdaeea722:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/db-client/package.json#L10-L14",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:17cfca37b68be3ba5ddf8b8d4f809e25ea56c8afdfc63f5b099ac53d4a6b8fd2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://turbo.json#L4-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f40332c2e684f0aa8b671187fa72f27bc16d35ff55cfbfd9b9abbd9410af30c2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9b3b6e95109c41beaa96196fa0df983d",
      "statement": "The root postinstall hook runs `prisma generate --schema=packages/db-client/prisma/schema.prisma`, so a fresh clone's npm install leaves a usable Prisma client without a separate generate step.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L21-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:df798e019bb53dac8e237f2ad7dc016274ee3cacedc4a0c34b5f248463c9e64a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_319d954e5ea04073904f906b70934960",
      "statement": "scripts/dev.sh is the sole host-side entry point for the containerized loop: it cds to the repo root and wraps `docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml`, mapping verify/test/e2e-install/e2e/shell to `run --rm toolchain bash /app/scripts/dev-container.sh <cmd>`, logs to `logs -f [svc]` with an all-services fallback, and psql to `exec postgres psql -U postgres -d forceorg_dev`; unknown arguments print the header comment and exit 1.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/dev-container.sh#L70-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0d43caa1e296ff9e0b2e8d9645961c92b30a8aaad9947e1c3e0b98a4f7abe894:"
        },
