        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fb78f3fdc6da4bd886f82a7e38bf8a69",
      "statement": "Dockerfile.dev bakes only the toolchain (Node 20 bookworm-slim, Chromium runtime libraries, npm ci --include=dev from manifests copied before source, plus a package-lock.json checksum in node_modules/.deps-stamp); source is never baked in so the image rebuilds only when manifests change.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile.dev#L9-L42",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e37a9933d7b5ed99c0a7d42df809fe3705a56db43deb6baa48f94bd881af2377:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_94928c85a51045e9b123d8a22b87636e",
      "statement": "dev.sh rebuild invokes `docker compose build --no-cache deps`, but docker-compose.dev.yml defines no `deps` service, so that build fails and the accompanying force-recreate of db-init never runs; the documented dependency-refresh workflow therefore depends on rebuilding the shared image directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.dev.yml#L18-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b5ecc7a08859f97159a4c94b863cbfe668e0bd2f33263d5bbd4c196e48332a07:"
