    {
      "id": "claim_6e7052b49e214fc1962b67b09d5d27b0",
      "statement": "The E2E loop is immune to host port 3000 collisions: dev-container.sh e2e runs `npx next build` then playwright test, and the committed Playwright config's webServer boots its own `npx next start -p 3456` with reuseExistingServer: false so the suite can never exercise a stale server holding the port.",
      "evidence": [
