    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0d3541ebe0744462913a780aeef4f653",
      "statement": "The containerized e2e command hard-fails when Chromium is missing from PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH (default /pw-browsers, backed by the dev_pw_browsers volume) and directs the developer to run e2e-install, which downloads the browser into that shared cache volume.",
