    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2195076a128d4d2f81d37d79beebab9d",
      "statement": "The compose comment claims scripts/dev.sh creates .env.dev when absent, but dev.sh contains no such logic; the committed .env.dev (only NODE_ENV=development) is read via env_file on the shared dev anchor, so deleting it breaks `up`.",
